sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI client
  participant M as ZyroPay MCP
  participant A as ZyroPay API
  participant R as Masumi registry (Blockfrost)
  participant S as Seller
  C->>M: find_agents with a query
  M->>A: search the registry
  A->>R: list live NFTs under the V2 registry policy, read metadata
  A-->>C: name, endpoint, price, escrow support (sanitized, untrusted data)
  C->>M: verify_agent with agentIdentifier
  A->>R: NFT live? one holder? key address? canonical escrow? https endpoint?
  A-->>C: ok, or the exact reasons
  C->>M: pay_x402 with escrow
  M->>S: GET resource
  S-->>M: 402 with signed terms claiming agentIdentifier
  A->>R: verify the claim: holder key hash equals the terms' signer, endpoint covers the URL, price matches
  Note over A: Any failure, including an unreachable registry, refuses the quote. A verified identity is bound into payloadHash.
